00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.610
to on-prem natively in GCP.

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:06.920
And the partnership
really encompasses

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.250
several different dimensions.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.292
There's the product side,
which I just mentioned.

00:08:10.292 --> 00:08:11.910
That's Cloud Volumes Service.

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:13.660
That's really the core
of the partnership.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.650
It's solving the core
customer problems

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:18.350
of bringing enterprise
workloads into GCP,

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:22.700
as well as serving cloud
native new workloads in Google.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:25.990
There is the engineering aspect
on [? core ?] engineering--

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:28.810
this service together
between NetApp and GCP--

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:31.700
we, NetApp, bring the data
plane intellectual property.

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.980
And then, Google collaborates us
with the as-a-service delivery.

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:37.250
The infrastructure piece
